    "'dd2' lists stand-ins (one is picked per monster); 'champion' lists the stronger DD2 '_b' forms used for",
    "'art' names another DD1 monster's animations for one DD1 has no files of its own for (carrion_eater_large).",
    "DD1's champion tier (_C) and sometimes for veterans (_B). Matched on role (front/back line), size and theme;",
    "SkillMatchTests checks every stand-in plays its DD1 monster's role at its size. A stand-in only uses the DD2",
    "skills whose kind (attack, or help to its side) its DD1 monster has, each shown as the closest DD1 skill.",
